[{"client_msg_id":"a7222ed6-8e0b-4d26-87d8-bc6bd0de79b9","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"GFM と Qiita の md の記法がごっちゃになっているな…","ts":"1615041719.004900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SJs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"850fe330-1601-4e8c-9693-3275635c4670","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/LumaKernel/vim-tsdetect\u003e\nどきゅめった、ででん （使っている人いるのでしょうか、使ってる方いたらぜひ教えてほしいです）\n\n```{\n  \"tsdetect.doNotCreateOnNode\": true,\n  \"tsdetect.doNothingIfConfigExists\": true\n}```\nそしてこういうオプションを作って上記をデフォルト値にした。 workspace config のみを使うように v3 で方向転換。すでに設定されていれば restart しないなどもしたのでめっちゃ restart するみたいなのもなくなった。","ts":"1615041522.003700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: LumaKernel/vim-tsdetect","id":1,"title":"LumaKernel/vim-tsdetect","title_link":"https://github.com/LumaKernel/vim-tsdetect","text":"Contribute to LumaKernel/vim-tsdetect development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29811106?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/LumaKernel/vim-tsdetect","original_url":"https://github.com/LumaKernel/vim-tsdetect"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i15Ob"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01QHA6VA2G","text":"\u003c@U01QHA6VA2G\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1614997560.000600","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U01A3S7LK4H","text":"\u003c@U01A3S7LK4H\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1614987760.000400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
